    'Born and raised in Los Angeles, I was exposed to the real estate industry at a very young age. Some of my earliest childhood memories include driving around with my father, collecting rents, remodeling and renovating commercial real estate properties. Real estate was second nature to me – a career path that I was destined to pursue.',
